  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 225.1,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "第二，α 太大，指数会下溢。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 229.01,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "书里说 α 超过五百，训练就停住。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 233.29,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "这一集把这两条都实测一遍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 236.91,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "还要看学出来的模板，到底准不准。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 240.73,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "先给 SoftMin 一个精确定义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 243.97,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "从一个三条距离的例子开始。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 247.19,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "三个零距离，正好能算出黄金值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 254.44,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "给定 k 个距离，d 一到 d k。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 257.92,
   "dur": 4.5,
   "speech": "SoftMin 等于负 α 分之一，乘 log 求和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 262.6,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "求和项是 e 的负 α d i 次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 266.47,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "取 α 等于一，三个距离都是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 270.38,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "三项指数都是一，求和等于三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 274.2,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "log 三等于一点零九八六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 277.56,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "除以负一，得到负一点零九八六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 281.48,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "这就是屏幕上的黄金值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 284.62,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "它等于负 log k，k 是三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 288.18,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "记住这个数，后面每一步都拿它校验。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 292.24,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speech": "为什么可导，要看梯度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 295.21,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "对每个距离求偏导。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 297.95,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "得到的权重就是 softmax。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 301.39,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "权重等于 e 的负 α d i 除以求和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 305.49,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "所有权重都是正数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 308.23,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "权重和恒等于一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 310.97,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "最小距离那一项权重最大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 314.33,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "α 越大，权重越尖，越接近 one-hot。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 318.75,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "代码里 softMinGrad 就是这个式子。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 322.54,
   "dur": 4.21,
   "speech": "解析梯度和数值梯度，误差实测为零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 326.94,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "SoftMin 还有两条性质值得记。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 330.51,
   "dur": 2.29,
   "speech": "第一，平移同变。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 332.99,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "所有距离加一个常数，结果也加这个常数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 337.45,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "它不是平移不变，这点常被写错。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 341.42,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "第二，它永远到不了 min。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 344.49,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "差多少？乘上 α 之后有界。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 348.6,
   "dur": 5.22,
   "speech": "α 等于一百万时，差乘 α 仍等于负 log 三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 354,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "我们用它当近似误差的口径。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 357.55,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "所以提高 α 只是逼近，不是相等。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 361.9,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "这也解释了后面为什么要有退火。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 365.57,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "训练分三段，α 从一到二十到两百。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 370.18,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "每段十轮，一共三十轮。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 373.35,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "小 α 先学位置，权重摊得开。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 377.39,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "大 α 再收紧到最小窗口。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 380.96,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "换档时目标函数变了。"
  },
  {
