   "index": 35,
   "start": 384.04,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "损失会向上跳一下，然后继续降。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 387.95,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "实测从一点四四打头，降到零点零一三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 392.42,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "三十轮损失降到原来的百分之一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 396.21,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "这是退火曲线的正常形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
